<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify Your Email - UniRooms</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background-color: #ecf0f1;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #34495e;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 35px;
        }

        .info-box {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-left: 3px solid #3498db;
            border-radius: 2px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            background: #3498db;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #2980b9;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 25px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .warning {
            background: #fff8e1;
            border-left: 3px solid #ffa000;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #666;
        }

        .url-box {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            word-break: break-all;
            color: #3498db;
            font-size: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Email Verification Required</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>Thank you for registering with UniRooms. To complete your registration and activate your account, please verify your email address by clicking the button below.</p>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Important Notice:</strong></p>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;">This verification link will expire in <strong>{{expiryTime}}</strong>. If the link expires, you may request a new verification email from your account settings.</p>
            </div>

            <p>If the button above does not work, please copy and paste the following URL into your web browser:</p>
            <div class="url-box">{{verificationUrl}}</div>

            <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 30px 0;">

            <div class="warning">
                <strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you did not create an account with UniRooms, please disregard this email. No further action is required.
            </div>

            <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The UniRooms Team</strong></p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>UniRooms</strong> - Student Accommodation Platform</p>
            <p>© {{year}} UniRooms. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Email: support@pgfinder.com</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>